Package: cubbies
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, python3-gi-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, libx11-6
Recommends: gir1.2-wnck-3.0
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: Cubbies <cubbies@localhost>
Description: Desktop cubbies that organise your icons
 Cubbies puts boxes on the desktop that hold icons for files, folders
 and applications, styled your way from see-through to solid. It supports
 several pages, each with its own cubbies and wallpaper, tabs, Folder
 Cubbies that show a real folder live, launch bars, sorting, cut/copy/paste,
 and a settings window.
 For Linux desktops running Cinnamon, MATE or Xfce on X11.
